  <book code="COL" style="id">EN_KTLT kuf_Katu,⋅Western_ltr Wed Mar 05 2025 09:33:11 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Colossians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thơ Kô-lô-se</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kô-lô-se</para>
  <para style="toc3">Col</para>
  <para style="mt">Kô-lô-se</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Phaau-lô, sưưq-đô ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih ting karnóq kiêng Yaang Pleng, lơq Ti-mô-thê, manưih adhi anó ưng nôôq he, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />pagơơi đóng nôôq manưih đu huuiq lơq adhi anó kah tadhơ lóóm kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih dhiq Kô-lô-se. Nhan ơơn phươk liêm lơq yươq rauha tââq Yaang Pleng, nek Ama lơq Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, tơk dhiq adhi anó.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Nôôq yi ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, Ama ưng Chuôq nôôq he, nek Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, kalóóng dyóp bhêêl gavơh nhan đóng adhi anó, <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />taai ơi xâng tơk lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó kalóóng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih lơq leq lóóm tanhơr đu adhi anó ve palơq tabhơt nôôq manưih đu huuiq. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Ơi tââq lóóm rââm bâân koom lơơi đóng adhi anó dhiq nôôq klaang Pleng, nek rau đu adhi anó ơi xâng bhêêl n'loom kalóóng paraaq taruuih ưng paraaq dhalam, nek Taruuih Liêm, <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />nek rau xók ve mat dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, hơq taruuih liêm achêk dyơq machak maraang lơq bâân xơơk vaaih dhiq tabhơt hóng katiêk ng'kơi, nek kung kơi achêk tơơt kalóóng adhi anó, xêi tââq tangêi adhi anó ơi xâng lơq hok n'nal ơơn phươk liêm ưng Yaang Pleng kalóóng paraaq dhalam, <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />dhalam kơi adhi anó ơi hok n'nal tââq Ê-phaap-ra, manưih marau tarnêêng nh'nhơr kiiq liêm ưng nôôq yi, ađó nek mưi dhơn ratơơq bhơt lóóm ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih klóóih mat nôôq yi, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />lơq nek manưih ơi pakah đóng nôôq yi n'nal lóóm tanhơr ưng adhi anó kalóóng Yaang Liêm.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Taai ađek, tââq tangêi nôôq yi xâng kơi chêk, nek nôôq yi kah dhêi gavơh nhan đóng adhi anó lơq nhan panhel, buôn đóng adhi anó bâân bing bhlaai rau tabech n'nal karnóq kiêng Chuôq dhiq dyóp rau tabech galang lơq dyóp n'nal lóóm huuiq, <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />đóng jađaang vôôiq kơi targlap palơq Chuôq kalóóng dyóp rau liêm kanóq Chuôq, machak maraang kalóóng ting tarnêêng kre liêm, bâân taha gamak kalóóng rau đơơp n'nal Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />bâân karơ gamak palơq bing bhlaai praan karơ mak mơ mataai raman cha-iil tabah ưng Ađó, đóng plêh tơk dyóp rau đơơp jruôn lơq đuôh đương lơq lóóm bhuui marhaal, <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />tapôông paraaq ma-ơơn Ama, Yaang ơi têêng adhi anó dyóp rau kơi tơơt kalóóng rau ting đơơp drươp karvaan palơq nôôq manưih huuiq Liêm kalóóng rau brương. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Chênh Yaang achêk ơi paq jóói nôôq he tââq mataai karơ ưng rau kanam kanheet, lơq đââng nôôq he tơk katiêk karuung ưng Akóón bơk nh'nhơr ưng Ađó, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />kalóóng Akóón achêk, nôôq he ve bâân paq klóóih, hơq nek rau lơơi matu lơt. <verse eid="COL 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Akóón achêk nek a-ô ưng Yaang Pleng kah chóóm lêi, nek Yaang yuur n'niên laloom tââm kalóóng dyóp rau n'dreh m'ma. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Taai kalóóng Akóón, dyóp n'dreh m'ma m'piing pleng palơq n'raal katiêk, ve a-ô palơq kah ve a-ô, maar ơi bâân tavaaih. Dhơ ve nek bhua kala, hamôôiq têêng kala, hamôôiq karơ kataai, hamôôiq kala xêi, nek tabhơt maar bâân tavaaih tââq Akóón lơq taai Akóón. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Akóón achêk ve laloom dyóp n'dreh m'ma, lơq dyóp n'dreh m'ma tambhô palơq xóng piđó kalóóng Akóón. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Akóón achêk kung nek akoq ưng achak araang, nek Akóón Dhơn Chuôq. Chênh Akóón achêk nek tââq tarnââp, nek Yaang yuur n'niên laloom tââm tââq pa-ô m'pơng manưih chêt, buôn đóng Akóón achêk têêng Yaang têêng akoq m'piing dyóp n'dreh m'ma. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Taai Yaang Pleng ơi iêm lóóm lơơi đóng dyóp rau dyóp liêm tơơt kalóóng Akóón, <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />lơq patóóng leq Akóón đóng paliêm dyóp n'dreh m'ma palơq chênh Ađó. Dhơ nek nôôq n'dreh m'ma n'raal katiêk môôiq dyóp n'dreh m'ma m'piing pleng, taai ơi đââng tơk rau paliêm tââq Akóón achêk ve ahaam dhiq dyung chatông ưng Akóón. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Bhêêl n'loom, Xók adhi anó bâân lêi nek manưih changaai chrih lơq nek manưih brau tarjơl kalóóng karnóq, kalóóng nôôq tarnêêng têêng aak. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Hơq xók ađôk, adhi anó ơi bâân paliêm ve akan chêt kalóóng achak araang ưng Akóón. Đóng pakah mat adhi anó toom mat Ađó, nek nôôq manưih liêm sek, kah madham madhôôn, lơq kah dhiq chóóm trêh, <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Bhơt m'bưưiq nek la adhi anó bhiêk tơơt kalóóng lóóm huuiq, đơơp chalót riêh, liêm mưng, lơq yươq bâân patââi tââq lóóm rââm ưng Taruuih Liêm đu adhi anó ơi xâng nek Taruuih Liêm ơi bâân truuih praaq đóng dyóp n'dreh m'ma n'raal pleng, hơq tââq ađek, aku, Phaau-lô, ơi xar kơi mưi dhơn ratơơq.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Xók ađôk aku bhuui marhaal kalóóng nôôq jarnah xaryô ưng ađêi taai adhi anó, lơq palơq achak araang ađêi, aku ơi buur bing nôôq phơn dyơq thiêuq kalóóng nôôq ka-ai karuôq ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih, ơi taai achak araang Ađó, hơq nek Akóón Dhơn Chuôq, <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />hơq tââq ađek, aku ơi xar kơi mưi dhơn ratơơq, ting rau jư lêi ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq tarnêêng achêk ơi bâân pajaau đóng aku taai adhi anó, đóng têêng paxong paraaq ưng Yaang Pleng, <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />rau lalââp hanua ơi bâân kadrêi lââp bhluuch nôôq klaang đơơi lơq bhluuch bơk klaang manưih. Hơq xók ađôk, lalââp hanua achêk ơi bâân pakah đóng nôôq manưih huuiq liêm ưng Ađó, <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />nek nôôq manưih đu Yaang Pleng kiêng pakah ng'kơi nek rau karvaan kabhôôq cha-iil tabah ưng rau lalââp hanua ađôk pa-ô m'pơng nôôq dhanuôr katiêk lââng, achêk nek Chuôq Paq Manưih kalóóng adhi anó, hơq nek lóóm parââm cha-iil tabah. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Achêk nek Yaang đu nôôq yi truuih praaq, xók patrêh dyóp ngaai, lơq pachóóm dyóp ngaai palơq tabhơt rau tarbech galang, đóng nôôq yi ve chóóm pakah mat dyóp ngaai nek dyóp liêm kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Kung taai rau ađek hơq aku nhưh nhok, tarjơl ting kơi trââi tarnêêng ưng Ađó dyơq matêêng palơq mataai raman kalóóng aku.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Taai aku kiêng adhi anó n'nal aku ve ganơt tarjơl gamak ađó mơ đóng adhi anó, lơq đóng nôôq manưih đu huuiq dhiq Laau-đi-xê, kung palơq n'nal mơ manưih dyơq kah glêh lêi mat aku leq dyaang achak, <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />đóng lóóm piđó bâân tabhơơl, xók bâân tabóq pajum palơq xóng ađêi kalóóng lóóm tanhơr, lơq malóóm tơk dyóp rau bhơt liêm ưng tarnêêng bâân n'nal bing dyóp dhakơi mưng, kađââng tơk rau đơơp n'nal rau lalââp hanua ưng Yaang Pleng, hơq nek Chuôq Paq Manưih, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />hơq kalóóng Ađó nek rau kaboq lââp tabhơt nôôq jơơng karvaan tabech galang lơq karnóq n'nal. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Aku praaq rau ađô đóng yươq ngaai ve chóóm galơơk chachââr adhi anó palơq bóóp paraaq iêm baq. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Taai dhơ alua nek aku kah ve mat palơq adhi anó kalóóng ng'kar m'bech, bơơi aku tơơt palơq adhi anó kalóóng lóóm kanóq, bhuui marhaal lơq bâân lêi charnap matư ma-iiq kalóóng adhi anó kung palơq praan karơ ưng lóóm huuiq ưng adhi anó kalóóng Chuôq Paq Manưih.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Kơi achêk hơq, dhalam xók adhi anó ơi đơơp huuiq Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih têêng Chuôq, nek phaai jađaang vôôiq kalóóng Ađó, <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />đơơp chalót riêh lơq bâân hayuur kadhơng kalóóng Ađó, palơq bâân têêng đóng tamưng kalóóng lóóm huuiq dhiêp kơi adhi anó ơi bâân pachóóm, palơq xưa raai kalóóng rau ma-ơơn.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Phaai chagơn óóq ve ngaai ađek e nek đu kóóp jư adhi anó palơq paraaq parhei lơq bhriêl tabech dharuông dhabóóih, ting taruuih ti ưng akóón manưih, ting nôôq dhale n'tót ưng akóón manưih, hơq kah ting Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Taai kalóóng Ađó, tabhơt rau bing dyóp ưng lóóm kanóq Yaang Pleng tơơt kalóóng achak araang akóón manưih, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />lơq adhi anó ơi bâân têêng đóng bing dyóp kalóóng Ađó, Yaang nek akoq ưng dyóp praan karơ lơq kala xanêi. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Hơq kalóóng Yaang achêk, adhi anó kung bâân iêt ng'kar palơq pheep iêt ng'kar kah taai têi akóón manưih têêng, bơơi palơq tarnêêng lôh lơơi lóóm kanóq manưih ti, hơq nek palơq pheep iêt ng'kar ưng Chuôq Kriit, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />taai ơi bâân tơp palơq Ađó kalóóng pheep bap-teem, lơq kalóóng Ađó adhi anó ơi bâân mamông lóóiq ve lóóm huuiq dhiq mataai raman ưng Yaang Pleng, Yaang ơi payuur Ađó mamông lóóiq tââq akan chêt. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Leq phơn adhi anó, dyơq xók chêt bil kalóóng nôôq tarnêêng lơt lơq kalóóng kơi talum achak araang kah ơi iêt ng'kar ưng ađêi, nek Ađó ơi têêng đóng adhi anó bâân mamông palơq Ađó, taai ơi lơơi dyóp têêng lơt đóng nôôq he, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />ơi katel sek bha-aar xaraq leq tarnêêng lơt jaklâk tarjơl nôôq he, ađek biêh nek rau tarjơl palơq nôôq he, lơq Ađó ơi tabil ađó tââq m'pơng piđó gluh, xók teeng đinh ađó dhiq m'baang chatông, <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />pagluh m'peq nôôq praan karơ lơq kala xanêi, Chuôq ơi têêng piđó vaaih pacheh karchang đóng akóón manưih, xók đươk lơh piđó dhiq m'baang chatông.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Kơi achêk hơq, óóq đóng ngaai praaq xêi adhi anó leq cha đah, lơq leq rau ơm, hamôôiq kalóóng pâng leq ưng tangêi bhiêk, tangêi kaxe blo, môôiq tangêi Sa-baat, <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />bơơi piđó chapiên nek m'beq a-ô ưng nôôq rau kanóq tơk, dyơq manưih ti mađó leq Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Óóq đóng ngaai đu têêng adhi anó bil aq phơn chaner, xók pakah kiêng malóóch têêng pathê moor dha-iiq lơq rau bhuôih kakoh dhơn Pleng, ting kơi nôôq rau manưih ti achak araang ơi lêi, xar vaaih grô próng kơi kah machak tââq kanóq kơi manưih ti ưng ađêi, <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />lơq kah bóq mưng palơq akoq, hơq tââq dhiq Ađó, tabhơt achak n'nal tââq nôôq bhakôq patet lơq talêi raraq bâân ban paar lơq ng'krô pajum palơq xóng piđó; achak araang achêk taha gamak palơq praan karơ tahayuur tơk tââq Yaang Pleng.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />La adhi anó ơi chêt palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, gluh tââq nôôq dharniêng habưưn ưng manưih hóng katiêk, nek taai ng'kơi kalóóng xók dyơq mamông m'pơng hóng katiêk, adhi anó lóóiq huuiq kơi nôôq dhale n'tót ưng ađó: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />“Kah kadhâng, kah tadyep, kah rapơq!” <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />hơq nek nôôq dharniêng habưưn đu tabhơt maar kađââng tơk rau pahư bil xók ting tađuui, kơi nôôq kadhâng gani lơq taruuih pachóóm ưng akóón manưih? <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Dhơ dhakơi ađek nek dharau tarnêêng, dhơ chrooq kađôôq đơơp ngóq tabech galang kalóóng bhiêk bhaan tư tavaaih, palơq rau moor dha-iiq lơq jarnah xaryô ưng achak araang, nek kah ve dhơ dharau n'đó kiiq liêm jaklâk lóóiq malóóch kiêng ưng manưih ti.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Kơi achêk hơq, la adhi anó ơi bâân têêng đóng mamông lóóiq palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek phaai chik-chêk nôôq rau tơơt dhiq pleng, tââq Chuôq Paq Manưih dyơq tơơt hót atươm Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Phaai malóóm tơk lóóm kanóq nôôq rau tơơt dhiq pleng, eh rau nôôq rau tơơt dhiq katiêk. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Taai adhi anó ơi chêt, lơq parmông adhi anó ơi bâân kadrêi palơq Chuôq Paq Manưih kalóóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Xók Chuôq Paq Manưih, nek parmông ưng adhi anó, tabhral, nek adhi anó kung e tabhral palơq Ađó kalóóng cha-iil tabah.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Kơi achêk hơq, phaai têêng chêt nôôq phơn n'raal katiêk, kơi têêng taniêt, rau anhuq, lóóm kiêng, malóóch môôp lơt, lơq n'thaam dhahik, hơq n'thaam dhahik nek bhuôih kabhêi, <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />taai nôôq rau ađô hơq ganơt pagrâ ưng Yaang Pleng dyơq bhral, <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />hơq n'loom ahei, adhi anó kung ơi jađaang vôôiq kalóóng nôôq rau achêk, xók adhi anó dyơq mamông kalóóng piđó. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Bơơi xók ađôk adhi anó phaai m'peq lơơi dyóp rau ađô, kơi grâ bha-ươk, jar-ââih, lơt kanóq, praaq tamôôp, palơq praaq tataaiq gluh tââq bóóp ađêi. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Óóq praaq chachââr xóng ađêi, taai ơi lôh lơơi akóón manưih ti palơq nôôq atóóch keen ưng ađó, <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />lơq ơi pei xơp akóón manưih tame, hơq nek manưih dyơq bâân têêng tame kalóóng rau tabech n'nal ting a-ô ưng Yaang tavaaih ađó, <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />nek dhiq đu kah ve manưih Hi-laap lơq manưih Jo Thaaiq, manưih iêt ng'kar lơq manưih kah iêt ng'kar, manưih thiêuq tabech, manưih Si-the, manưih têêng xól, manưih têêng kala, bơơi Chuôq Paq Manưih nek dyóp rau, lơq kalóóng dyóp rau.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Kơi achêk hơq, kơi manưih bâân chââih ưng Yaang Pleng, nek manưih liêm lơq bâân nh'nhơr bơk, phaai pei xơp lóóm kayô ka-er, matư ma-iiq, pa-êêp ađêi, moor dha-iiq, đuôh jruôn, <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />đơơp kađung xóng ađêi lơq lơơi lơt xóng ađêi. La kơi ngaai ađek ve rau m'bhoonh palơq palââng, hơq kơi Chuôq ơi lơơi lơt adhi anó ng'kơi, adhi anó kung kiêng phaai kơi achêk. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Bơơi m'piing dyóp rau achêk, phaai pei xơp lóóm tanhơr, hơq nek tahaal patet alet ưng rau bhơt liêm. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Phaai đóng rau yươq rauha ưng Chuôq Paq Manưih têêng kala kalóóng lóóm adhi anó, hơq adhi anó kung ơi bâân dhaloong tơk yươq rauha ađek kalóóng mưi achak araang lơq phaai pakah lóóm n'nal ơơn. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Phaai lơơi đóng Paraaq Chuôq Paq Manưih tơơt kalóóng adhi anó kơi xưa raai, xók pachóóm Palơq tabhơt rau tabech brương, tabhơơl xóng ađêi palơq nôôq haanh pleng, nôôq guôp babóóch chaxuul lơq nôôq guôp bhanóóch babóóch chaxuul, palơq rau n'nal ơơn kalóóng lóóm ađêi koom đóng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Dyóp tarnêêng đu adhi anó têêng, dhơ palơq paraaq praaq môôiq palơq têêng vôôiq, phaai têêng tabhơt kalóóng dhanóók Chuôq, nek Chuôq Jê-su, n'nal Patââq Ađó ma-ơơn Yaang Pleng, nek Ama.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Manưih têêng kađiêl phaai xâng bóóp kayiik ađêi, kơi ađek nek rau dhalam liêm kalóóng Chuôq. <verse eid="COL 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Manưih têêng kayiik phaai nh'nhơr kađiêl ađêi, lơq óóq grâ jar-ââih palơq kađiêl. <verse eid="COL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Manưih têêng akóón phaai xâng bóóp konh akan ađêi kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng, taai ađô nek rau liêm lóóm Chuôq. <verse eid="COL 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Manưih têêng akonh, óóq ơơr garâ akóón anaaq ađêi, đóng piđó yươq bil lóóm. <verse eid="COL 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Manưih têêng dhơn ratơơq, phaai huuiq bóóp kala ađêi leq phơn achak kalóóng dyóp tarnêêng, eh rau palơq rau cha met lêi ưng kala kơi nôôq manưih buôn pei lóóm palââng, bơơi palơq lóóm lalua dhalam, bhi kakhin Chuôq. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Dhơ adhi anó têêng mak rauriq, phaai têêng patư tââq luônh lóóm pakơi têêng đóng Chuôq hơq eh rau đóng akóón manưih, <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />taai n'nal kakơi ađêi e đơơp phơn chaner leq drươp karvaan ađêi patư tââq Chuôq. Adhi anó dyơq têêng dhơn ratơơq đóng Chuôq, chênh nek Chuôq Paq Manưih. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Hơq ngaai manưih têêng rau lơt môôp e đơơp lóóiq rau đu manưih ađek ơi têêng kơi lơt môôp; lơq kah ve rau paq katơq!<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Manưih têêng kala phaai đââng tơk đóng nôôq dhơn ratơơq ưng ađêi rau dhalam tapat lơq marđơq. Taai n'nal kakơi ađêi kung ve mưi Kala dhiq pleng.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Phaai bhơt lóóm kalóóng rau gavơh nhan. Xók meh lóóm kalóóng tarnêêng têêng ađô palơq rau ma-ơơn, <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Kung kơi makơi xóng ađêi gavơh nhan klóóih đóng nôôq yi, buôn đóng Yaang Pleng lóng đóng nôôq yi karđơp palóng ưng tarnêêng truuih taruuih liêm, đóng gluh praaq rau hanua palââp leq Chuôq Paq Manưih. Kung taai hanua palââp ađek hơq aku bâân takađaai. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Ng'kơi đóng aku ve chóóm truuih pakah hanua palââp achêk kơi drêh dróói, kơi aku phaai papraaq. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Phaai cha tơơt kalóóng rau tabech galang palơq manưih kah huuiq, xók kapươk tangêi kaxe. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Bóóp paraaq adhi anó phaai taluôn ve kanóq hóng lóóm; xók kadyeep bhóh mót, đóng n'nal rau achêk kơng bhlơng đóng adhi anó nek ng'kơi đóng tar-ââi palơq ting mưi chanak manưih.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Dyóp tarnêêng pâng tơk aku, nek mưi chanak adhi anó bơk nh'nhơr, mưi dhơn ratơơq bhơt lóóm, lơq mưi manưih marau tarnêêng kalóóng Chuôq, nek Ti-chi-kơ e pakah đóng adhi anó n'nal, <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />ađó achêk nek manưih đu aku yua tơk talum adhi anó ơi taai kơi ađôk, ađek nek đóng adhi anó n'nal kơi tanơơt mamông leq nôôq yi, lơq đóng ađó achêk ve chóóm tabhơơl lóóm adhi anó, <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />ting vôôiq nek Ô-nê-siim, manưih adhi anó kah dhơ lóóm lơq bơk nh'nhơr, ađó achêk ve gluh tââq adhi anó, piđó e đóng adhi anó n'nal dyóp tarnêêng dhiq ađô.<verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />A-ri-taak, parjơơk tơơt đong kanam ưng aku, tamóh tham adhi anó, kung palơq Maak, adhi kabhuh ưng Ba-na-ba (adhi anó ơi bâân đơơp paraaq pató leq ađó achêk la ađó achêk tơk leq adhi anó, nek phaai pơh yaauq ađó achêk), <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />kung kơi Jê-su, manưih bâân đóók nek Juk-tu dyơq. Kalóóng nôôq manưih ve gluh tââq nek manưih ơi iêt ng'kar, piđó nek nôôq parjơơk marau tarnêêng mưi giêl palơq aku taai katiêk karuung ưng Yaang Pleng, piđó nek rau tabhơơl đóng aku. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Ê-phaap-ra tamóh tham adhi anó, ađó achêk gluh tââq adhi anó, nek mưi dhơn ratơơq ưng Jê-su Chuôq Paq Manưih, xók taluôn tarjơl taai adhi anó kalóóng rau gavơh nhan, đóng adhi anó bâân têêng đóng tamưng, gamak karơ, lơq huuiq mưng kalóóng dyóp karnóq kiêng ưng Yaang Pleng. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Taai aku truuih pan-nal leq ađó achêk, kơi ađó achêk ơi đơơp hadhơơp nhok lóng bơk taai adhi anó, kung kơi taai nôôq manưih huuiq dhiq Laau-đi-xê lơq dhiq Hi-ê-ra-bô-li. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Lu-ka, manưih payươh ka-ai bơk nh'nhơr, palơq Đê-ma, tamóh tham adhi anó. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Nhan tamóh tham nôôq adhi anó dhiq Laau-đi-xê, lơq Niim-pha, palơq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq nhoom dhiq đong ưng pađiil achêk. <verse eid="COL 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Xók tala thơ ađôk ơi bâân đok xong dhiq m'pơng adhi anó, alua dhakơi kơi ađó kung bâân đok dhiq Akóón Dhơn Chuôq Laau-đi-xê, lơq dhakơi adhi anó kung phaai đok thơ tââq Laau-đi-xê dyơq. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Nhan praaq palơq A-chiip, kơi ađô: “Phaai kanóq chamet leq tarnêêng đu amei ơi đơơp kalóóng Chuôq, đóng amei ve chóóm têêng paxong liêm tarnêêng ađek.”<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Paraaq tamóh tham ađôk taai chênh têi aku, Phaau-lô, Phaai hei tơk nôôq tarlêi kađaai ưng aku. Nhan ơơn phươk liêm tơơt palơq adhi anó.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>